WEBVTT

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:35.870
Tomoe

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:49.150
A Rosa Mystica...

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:55.890
A Rosa... Mystica...

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:58.060
Souseiseki!

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:14.550
So this is... a Rosa Mystica...

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:18.680
Suigintou, hand that over, you!

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:21.110
That is... That Rosa Mystica is...

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:22.750
No!

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:25.280
I'm taking this.

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:29.090
Because... I've won it.

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:43.740
My body... feels warm...

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:47.360
This is the power of a Rosa Mystica...

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:53.450
Suigintou, you...

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:55.860
What's that look on your face?

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:58.370
If you want to fight,
 I'll take you on.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:01.890
Still playing goody two-shoes?

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:03.960
Shinku, you really are...

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:06.430
...such a dummy.

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:14.490
How exceptionally sharp.

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:17.340
I wonder if I have Souseiseki's
Rosa Mystica to thank for that.

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:19.130
Shinku!

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:20.810
Souseiseki...

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:23.040
Souseiseki!

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:26.300
You all are weak.

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:29.000
Shinku...

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:41.460
Too bad...

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:44.400
I have no intention of acting
in accordance with your wishes.

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:46.080
Bye-bye.

00:03:54.820 --> 00:03:56.990
One player has taken her leave.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:00.910
And yet another has 
disappeared into the wings.

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:05.650
It is time for a brief intermission
until the second act.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.290
Laplace, you...

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:17.160
It is imperative that you do
what needs doing quickly.

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:21.560
...for the jester before 
you is most capricious.

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:30.270
Are you displeased?

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:50.360
Souseiseki-chan...

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:56.770
Souseiseki... Souseiseki...

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:02.540
This is... the Alice Game...

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:06.040
<i>The Alice Game...</i>

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:14.550
<i>Once the Alice Game starts,
will we have to fight too?</i>

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:17.290
<i>Suiseiseki will not fight.</i>

00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:22.290
<i>If it means that I must rob you
of your Rosa Mystica...</i>

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:26.030
<i>...I do not care if I 
cannot become Alice.</i>

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:28.600
<i>You're strong.</i>

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:31.090
<i>O-Of course!</i>

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:33.950
<i>So do not say such strange things!</i>

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:36.740
<i>For you... For you...</i>

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:40.020
<i>Suiseiseki will protect you!</i>

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:51.080
Suiseiseki...

00:05:51.590 --> 00:05:53.240
Suiseiseki is...

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:55.200
Suiseiseki is...

00:05:57.010 --> 00:05:58.290
Wipe your tears.

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:03.860
Souseiseki would surely not have
wanted to see you like this.

00:06:26.730 --> 00:06:28.220
Suiseiseki.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:33.510
It is true that Souseiseki's soul
is far away from us now...

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:37.960
...but souls do respond to a voice
calling them back from afar.

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:41.470
Even though we are apart,
we will definitely see her again.

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:44.300
So... for now...

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:50.480
She is only sleeping, 
just for a little while.

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:53.240
Just for a little while...

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:42.880
It is no use.

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:47.400
You are unlikely to be able to save her
with just that piece.

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:50.900
To save her, you must collect
all the Rosa Mysticas...

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:56.450
...and through yourself,
transfer that power to your medium.

00:07:57.380 --> 00:07:59.080
Is that how it is...

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:02.930
In that case, I'll need 
your Rosa Mystica too.

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:04.910
Miss Angel?

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:10.520
You came for me...

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:15.010
It's so pretty...

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:21.830
Why do you laugh?

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:26.330
Was I laughing?

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:31.380
I think it's because of this light.

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:35.680
So clear and warm and evanescent...

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:40.050
I like this light.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.020
Make repairs?

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:47.440
Yes.

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:49.000
It's possible.

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:50.560
Really?

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:54.830
But even with repairs,
not everything can be restored.

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:59.270
A soul that has departed to
a faraway place will not return.

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:10.620
If there were someone
that could manipulate that...

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:12.180
That would be...

00:09:20.900 --> 00:09:21.960
Jun-kun!

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:24.670
Hina-chan...

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.510
What happened?

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:35.160
It has started.

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:41.340
Hina-Ichigo's Rosa Mystica
will leave her body soon.

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:42.890
But that's...

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:45.580
I thought this would happen someday.

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:50.510
Hina-Ichigo was defeated in battle
and lost her ring.

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:54.520
Properly speaking, she is not fit
to remain in the Alice Game.

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:57.090
She was able to move till now...

00:09:57.390 --> 00:10:01.010
...because she had been using
your power through me.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:06.730
Now that Souseiseki has been robbed
of her Rosa Mystica...

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:10.800
Father will not allow that anymore.

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:12.350
But that's...

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:16.540
Your power will no longer 
reach Hina-Ichigo.

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:20.280
When she has used up the power
still remaining in her...

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:31.860
How are you feeling, Hina-Ichigo?

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:33.560
Okay! Oh, Jun!

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:35.470
Y-Yeah...

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:36.790
Welcome home!

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:40.180
A Jun climb to welcome you home!

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:42.800
Yay! Yay! Jun!

00:11:00.420 --> 00:11:02.150
Yay!

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:03.800
Tomoe! Tomoe!

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:06.120
Tomoe's house is right here!

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:11.870
Here.

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:14.600
Oh, it's Mr. Domoko Dragon!

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:17.330
Komodo dragon.

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:18.850
Also, here.

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:22.340
Soft Rice
Cake

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:22.340
Oh, it's unyuu!

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:24.240
Thank you, Jun!

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:26.820
Sure. Don't eat too much now.

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:27.580
I won't!

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:29.580
Well...

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:33.380
Jun!

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:36.120
Wait just a minute.

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:39.870
Hina-Ichigo?

00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:41.560
Wait just a minute!

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:44.960
Oomph... Oomph...

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:46.880
Found it!

00:11:48.130 --> 00:11:49.530
Here you go!

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:51.270
This is...

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:53.500
Take it for her sake.

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:19.660
<i>Hina-Ichigo...</i>

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:21.420
<i>No!</i>

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:26.380
<i>Tomoe, you said you'd come home
early today, and you lied.</i>

00:12:27.270 --> 00:12:29.900
<i>You're right. I'm sorry.</i>

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:34.540
<i>Then I'll give you this 
as a token of apology.</i>

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:40.600
<i>H-Hina can't be bought off
with something like that!</i>

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.550
<i>It's no ordinary coin, you know.</i>

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:46.290
<i>Oh!</i>

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.820
<i>See? Isn't it a magical coin?</i>

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:51.260
<i>That's amazing!</i>

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:01.900
<i>Here!</i>

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:05.150
<i>I saw it on TV.</i>

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:08.310
<i>If you have this,
you'll win your match!</i>

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:09.640
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:12.880
Smiley
Crayons

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:19.620
<i>Hina-Ichigo, what are you doing?</i>

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:21.420
<i>I'm leaving them here.</i>

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:25.350
<i>Jun's sort of scary.</i>

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:29.390
<i>If I take the things I care about,
he might throw them away.</i>

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:33.340
<i>It'll be all right with Sakurada-kun.</i>

00:13:33.340 --> 00:13:37.400
<i>When I'm sure Jun's not scary,
I'll come back for them...</i>

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:39.940
<i>...so I want you to hold on to them.</i>

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:41.210
<i>Hina-Ichigo...</i>

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:45.900
<i>That way, I can come see you again!</i>

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:52.320
I'm happy for you,
 Sakurada-kun...

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:55.380
Hina-Ichigo.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:58.200
Wanna play?

00:13:58.200 --> 00:14:00.950
Yeah! Okay... Okay...

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:01.990
Hide-and-seek!

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:05.890
All right.
 Then I'll be it.

00:14:06.410 --> 00:14:07.660
One.

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:09.000
Two.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:13.000
Um... Um... Um...

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:11.240
Three.

00:14:11.650 --> 00:14:13.000
Four.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:14.790
Five.

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:16.180
Six.

00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:18.010
Hina-Ichigo?

00:14:18.680 --> 00:14:19.950
Hina-Ichigo!

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:29.520
Something's... wrong...

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:33.280
I napped so much too...

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:35.730
Hina-Ichigo...

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:40.200
Shall we comb out your hair?

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:41.780
Okay!

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:48.500
Hello.

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:53.510
Huh?

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:59.210
There's nowhere left to run now,
Count Sea Eagle!

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:01.520
Eagle, eagle, eagle, eagle!

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:04.290
You have done well to chase me down
all the way here, eagle.

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:08.020
Detective Kun-kun,
I will remember your name, eagle!

00:15:08.680 --> 00:15:09.460
Hold it!

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:12.690
That darn sea eagle 
pisses me off, I guess?

00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:25.200
You two, come with me.

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:26.990
Shinku...

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:33.710
In the end, it still feels 
the best when you do it.

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:36.780
Really?

00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:43.980
Tomoe.

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:45.300
What is it?

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:51.230
Thank you...

00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:57.080
Hina's going to stop...

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:01.270
soon, right?

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:07.090
Seeing Jun and Shinku and you,

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:10.120
Hina figured it out.

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:13.140
Because I'm not a child anymore...

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:20.260
Hina's not scared, you know.

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:24.100
Because being with everyone...

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:26.830
I had... lots of fun...

00:16:32.270 --> 00:16:34.450
Getting to know you...

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:36.260
and meeting Shinku...

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:39.080
And going to Jun's house...

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:41.170
Everyone

00:16:41.170 --> 00:16:46.920
was always there for me, so...

00:16:51.450 --> 00:16:52.820
Tomoe?

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:55.790
Are you... crying?

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:59.850
I'm sorry. It's Hina's...

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:01.660
It's Hina's...

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:03.300
It's not!

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:04.470
Tomoe?

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:08.060
I'm the one who should be thanking you.

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:13.210
I was happy that you were there for me.

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:15.380
You always...

00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:17.750
always cheered me up.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:20.840
Even after you went to 
Sakurada-kun's house...

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:23.850
I thought about you every day!

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:27.410
Every time I came back 
to my room alone...

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:30.530
I wondered what you 
were doing right then.

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:33.760
I worried that you 
might forget about me.

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:38.940
But you never did, and you
always remembered me...

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:42.770
...even though I wasn't able
to do anything for you!

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.690
That's not true.

00:17:46.730 --> 00:17:50.780
You woke me from my sleep.

00:17:51.230 --> 00:17:54.660
You got me out of my case.

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:56.420
Hina-Ichigo...

00:17:56.740 --> 00:18:00.290
Tomoe...

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:02.450
Hina-Ichigo...

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:05.220
Don't cry.

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:08.300
It'll be okay.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:11.540
Even when Hina's gone,

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:16.600
everyone will be there for you...

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:23.680
You won't... be... alone...

00:18:34.560 --> 00:18:38.990
It'll... be... okay.

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:04.460
Hina-Ichigo.

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:08.200
Hina-Ichigo!

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:23.210
A Rosa Mystica...

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:23.940
Don't tell me...

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:30.310
Hina-Ichigo...

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:42.080
Hina-Ichigo...

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:44.520
Shinku...

00:19:48.340 --> 00:19:51.540
Even apart, we will 
definitely meet again.

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:54.670
So she did not want us to be sad.

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:56.270
That is what she said.

00:19:56.810 --> 00:19:57.850
Hina...

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:01.400
O-Of course.

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:06.840
Both Hina-Ichigo and Souseiseki
will return without fail.

00:20:07.230 --> 00:20:08.780
Without fail...

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:13.240
This is...

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:16.790
This field will also go to sleep...

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:19.370
Into a peaceful slumber.

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:28.540
<i>Father...</i>

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:32.000
<i>Is this what you desire, Father?</i>

00:20:33.390 --> 00:20:34.500
<i>This...</i>

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:49.280
This place...

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:50.290
You guys...

00:20:51.030 --> 00:20:52.390
What are you doing here?

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:55.440
What is this place, Jun?

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:57.360
I told you, didn't I?

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:00.860
That the deep forest is 
a labyrinthine forest.

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:02.600
The demon Laplace...

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:15.380
It can't be...

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:24.490
It seems we fell into a trap.

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:29.030
Fair is foul, 
and foul is fair.

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:32.230
Thinking is a useless act.

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:37.230
However, the incontrovertible
reality is right there.

00:21:43.270 --> 00:21:44.070
Bara-Suishou!

00:21:44.370 --> 00:21:45.690
It can't be...

00:21:46.850 --> 00:21:50.620
It will not be much longer 
before Alice is born.

00:21:51.670 --> 00:21:52.810
Father...

00:21:58.100 --> 00:21:59.550
Father...

00:23:42.550 --> 00:23:44.140
Rozen Maidens.

00:23:44.140 --> 00:23:45.460
The Alice Game.

00:23:45.850 --> 00:23:47.070
Battle.

00:23:47.070 --> 00:23:48.180
Destiny.

00:23:48.740 --> 00:23:50.540
It cannot be defied.

00:23:51.250 --> 00:23:53.530
Only one will become Alice.

00:23:54.060 --> 00:23:58.170
That is the way Father
has determined it shall be.

00:23:59.130 --> 00:24:01.900
Next time on Rozen Maiden Träumend.

00:24:03.370 --> 00:24:06.550
Its melody is like a dream.

00:24:05.880 --> 00:24:10.850
Chapter 11
Rose Garden
